<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Dec trade deficit falls to $66.1 million.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Dec trade deficit falls to $66.1 million.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details:</p>
<p>SLOVENIA TRADE (in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>					Dec    Nov     Dec 95</p>
<p>    Trade balance	     -66.1   -169.2   -195.8</p>
<p>    Exports		     651.4    685.4   611.9</p>
<p>    Imports		     717.6    854.5   807.7</p>
<p>(NOTE: Differences due to rounding.) -- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
